WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.548
Open a workspace

00:00:16.548 --> 00:00:42.446
Set checks and review

00:00:42.446 --> 00:00:51.362
Send the request

00:00:51.362 --> 00:00:57.616
Watch the agents

00:00:57.616 --> 00:01:11.460
Keep the failed attempt

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:38.984
Request the correction

00:01:38.984 --> 00:02:08.236
Run checks and review again

00:02:08.236 --> 00:02:22.402
Inspect the approved result

00:02:22.402 --> 00:02:36.199
Download the turn receipt

00:02:36.199 --> 00:02:53.338
Inspect the code changes

00:02:53.338 --> 00:02:59.067
Keep the final receipt
